('inspire-women-honors', 'Annual Accolade Honors for Excellence', 'Mrs. Amruta Rao & Managing Council', 'Celebrating Trailblazing Women in Literature, Cinema & Public Service', 'Women of Inspiration', 'Women of Inspiration', 'Editor-in-Chief Mrs. Amruta Rao and Managing Director Mrs. Sakshi Sagvekar announce nominations for the 2026 Accolade Honors.', 'The honors recognize grassroots innovators, cultural custodians, and corporate trailblazers who have demonstrated exceptional leadership and societal upliftment.', 'https://ik.imagekit.io/acooladescreenlady/assets/images/team/amruta-rao.jpeg', 'Screenlady Boardroom', '2026-10-30', 'Oct 30, 2026', 1794860000000, '2026-10-30T15:00:00Z');

